#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/use-source-sdk.md:8
msgid "使用 Source SDK 与升级工程"
msgstr "Use a Source SDK and upgrade a project"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/use-source-sdk.md:10
msgid ""
"Source SDK 是带选中源码、依赖、许可和 CMake 元数据的可搬移包。应用在自己的 配置下重新编译，不混用其他配置的对象文件。SDK "
"的制作和平台完整消费者验证由 [维护者发布流程](../development/sdk-publishing.md)负责。"
msgstr ""
"A Source SDK is a relocatable package of selected source, dependencies, "
"licenses and CMake metadata. Applications compile it again for their own "
"configuration; do not mix object files from other configurations. SDK "
"creation and complete platform consumer validation belong to the [maintainer"
" release workflow](../development/sdk-publishing.md)."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/use-source-sdk.md:14
msgid "选择并验证包"
msgstr "Select and verify a package"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/use-source-sdk.md:16
msgid "从所选交付记录取得 SDK、校验和及完整源码提交。将整个 prefix 移到使用位置， 设置其路径与期望提交："
msgstr ""
"Obtain the SDK, checksum and full source commit from the selected delivery "
"record. Move the entire prefix to its consumption location and set its path "
"and expected commit:"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/use-source-sdk.md:26
msgid ""
"校验必须成功。缺失、多出、修改或 symlink 的 payload 都会拒绝。正式消费使用 可发布包；开发 fixture 明确是另一范围，不用 "
"opt-in 掩盖身份或接口不匹配。 包已包含所选依赖，不再在 prefix 内执行源码子模块准备或安装工具。"
msgstr ""
"Verification must succeed. Missing, additional, modified or symlinked "
"payload entries are rejected. Formal consumption uses a publishable package;"
" a development fixture is a separate explicit scope, and opt-in must not "
"conceal identity or interface mismatches. The package already contains "
"selected dependencies; do not prepare source submodules or install tools "
"inside the prefix."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/use-source-sdk.md:30
msgid "配置现有应用"
msgstr "Configure an existing application"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/use-source-sdk.md:32
msgid "应用保留自己的 CMake、TOML 和 C 源。从应用目录选择独立输出目录："
msgstr ""
"Keep the application CMake, TOML and C sources. From the application "
"directory, select a separate output directory:"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/use-source-sdk.md:43
msgid ""
"这条命令适用于带 Native 测试的应用，SDK 须包含 `host-support`。ARM 应用使用 另一个构建目录，并在 configure "
"时增加 prefix 内的 `share/nexus/src/cmake/toolchains/arm-gcc.cmake`；不需要 Native "
"时省略 `NEXUS_TEST_SUPPORT`。应用的三个 CMake 调用见[CMake 接入](cmake-consumption.md)。"
msgstr ""
"This command applies to an application with Native tests, and the SDK must "
"include `host-support`. For an ARM application, use another build directory "
"and add the prefix-local `share/nexus/src/cmake/toolchains/arm-gcc.cmake` "
"during configuration. Omit `NEXUS_TEST_SUPPORT` when Native is not required."
" See [CMake integration](cmake-consumption.md) for the three application "
"calls."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/use-source-sdk.md:48
msgid ""
"成功出口由应用确定：Native 实际运行与 fresh 测试报告，或 ARM 镜像、向量与资源 报告。配置和链接成功不包含 MCU "
"实际执行结论。消费后再次运行完整 prefix 校验。"
msgstr ""
"The application defines success: actual Native execution and fresh test "
"reports, or ARM images, vectors and resource reports. Successful "
"configuration and linking do not establish execution on an MCU. After "
"consumption, verify the complete prefix again."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/use-source-sdk.md:51
msgid "升级已有工程"
msgstr "Upgrade an existing project"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/use-source-sdk.md:53
msgid "保留应用源与 `.nexus-template.json`，记录旧 SDK、完整提交、profile、工具链和工件摘要，再核验下一份 SDK 的身份。"
msgstr ""
"Keep the application sources and `.nexus-template.json`. Record the previous"
" SDK, full commit, profile, toolchain and artifact digests before verifying"
" the identity of the next SDK."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/use-source-sdk.md:54
msgid "阅读对应变更和[源码接口兼容性](../reference/contracts/sdk-format.md)，检查 factory 代际、TOML schema、Board、后端和工具链。"
msgstr ""
"Read the relevant changes and [source-interface "
"compatibility](../reference/contracts/sdk-format.md). Check the factory "
"epoch, TOML schema, Board, backend and toolchain."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/use-source-sdk.md:55
msgid "用同一应用输入在独立目录分别构建旧版和候选版。通过 `Nexus_DIR` 和期望提交选择 SDK，重新生成并编译全部相关对象。"
msgstr ""
"Build the previous and candidate versions with the same application inputs "
"in separate directories. Select the SDK with `Nexus_DIR` and the expected "
"revision, then regenerate and compile all relevant objects."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/use-source-sdk.md:56
msgid "对照 ARM 资源报告，执行产品需要的 Native、ARM 和硬件检查，并在消费前后校验 SDK。验收完成后更新产品依赖锁。"
msgstr ""
"Compare the ARM resource reports, run the Native, ARM and hardware checks "
"required by the product, and verify the SDK before and after consumption. "
"Update the product dependency lock after acceptance."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/use-source-sdk.md:57
msgid "在独立构建目录用上一份锁和 SDK 验证回退，保留其工件与复验记录。产品数据迁移和回退仍由产品决定。"
msgstr ""
"Verify rollback with the previous lock and SDK in a separate build directory. "
"Retain the previous artifacts and the verification record. The product owns "
"its data migration and rollback decisions."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/use-source-sdk.md:59
msgid "记录候选版本的兼容和验证范围。长期维护承诺需要明确支持窗口、修复回移和可重建依赖的证据。"
msgstr ""
"Record the candidate's compatibility and verification scope. A long-term "
"maintenance commitment needs a defined support window and evidence of fix "
"backports and rebuildable dependencies."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/use-source-sdk.md:61
msgid ""
"模板来源记录描述工程最初从哪里创建，不会自动改成新 SDK 身份。平台版本、factory 接口代际、TOML schema、typed IR 与 "
"SDK manifest schema 各自负责不同合同；相同 版本号不能替代精确提交，也不能证明二进制兼容。"
msgstr ""
"Template provenance records where the project was originally created; it "
"does not automatically become the new SDK identity. Platform version, "
"factory interface epoch, TOML schema, typed IR and SDK manifest schema "
"govern separate contracts. An identical version string cannot replace an "
"exact commit or establish binary compatibility."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/use-source-sdk.md:65
msgid ""
"原 Kconfig／宏实例、旧请求字段与目录迁移只按匹配版本的固定记录读取。当前工程用 TOML、强类型 factory "
"和显式生命周期；不要在未知字段后回退到旧配置或生成文件。 常见失败见[排错指南](troubleshooting.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Read original Kconfig/macro instances, old request fields and directory "
"migrations only in matching, fixed-version records. Current projects use "
"TOML, strong typed factories and explicit lifecycle. Do not fall back to old"
" configuration or generated files after an unknown-field error. See "
"[troubleshooting](troubleshooting.md) for common failures."
